      <div class="section-hero uk-position-relative uk-light">
  <div class="uk-background-norepeat uk-background-cover uk-background-center-center background-hero uk-flex uk-flex-middle" data-src="https://wfe-live.lon1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/org_focus/storage/resources/resize/1600_0_crop/img_11733b2120c8df3e91e7b7127c7e55cc.jpeg" uk-img="loading: eager" uk-height-viewport="offset-bottom: 40; min-height: 600">
    <div class="uk-position-cover overlay-primary lighter"></div>
    <div class="uk-width-1-1">
      <div class="uk-position-cover uk-flex uk-flex-left uk-flex-middle uk-container uk-container-large container-hero">
        <div class="uk-grid-medium " uk-grid>
          <div class="uk-width-3-5@m">
            <div class="hero-text">
              <h1 class="h2">The WFE exists for its members, and currently represents more than 250 exchanges and CCPs of all sizes from around the world.</h1>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
      
      
      
        

        

        

        
      
      
      
      <section class="uk-section uk-section-default uk-padding-remove-bottom">
        <div class="uk-container uk-container-large">
          <div uk-grid>
            <div class="uk-width-1-1">
              <p>Membership of the WFE is a business-critical and strategic decision for financial market infrastructures, as by joining the association you will enjoy a wide range of benefits. These range from advocacy on the topics that matter to you, education tools, and cutting-edge research, right through to sector-specific workshops, conferences and events. Moreover, by becoming a WFE member, you will have special in-depth access to our world-leading statistics database.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div uk-grid class="uk-child-width-1-1">
            <div>
              <h3>Membership is open to exchanges or CCPs that:</h3>
              <div uk-grid class="uk-grid-match uk-margin-medium-top uk-grid-small uk-child-width-1-4@m membership-box" uk-scrollspy="cls: uk-animation-fade; target: > div > .primary; delay: 500;">
                                  <div>
                    <div class="primary uk-padding">
                      <span>Meet the membership criteria.</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                                  <div>
                    <div class="primary uk-padding">
                      <span>Have successfully gone through the membership admission process.</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                                  <div>
                    <div class="primary uk-padding">
                      <span>Have been admitted as members by the WFE Board of Directors at the General Assembly.</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                                  <div>
                    <div class="primary uk-padding">
                      <span>Play an active role in the development of their local economy.</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                              </div>
            </div>

